    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch has kidnapped the prince and the princess. As the royal wizard, you have been severed in half so you can go rescue both at the same time, but first you\u2019ll need to learn to control the two halves of your body simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a series of quick single-screen platforming levels, Ambidextro will help you master controlling two characters at once, one with each hand. Learn to split your focus and tackle increasingly challenging levels you would have thought impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A multi-player game for a single player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Control one character with each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Make your two-halves meet before the time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 100  levels to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Retro dark-fantasy atmosphere with a dungeon synth soundtrack.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch has kidnapped the prince and the princess. As the royal wizard, you have been severed in half so you can go rescue both at the same time, but first you\u2019ll need to learn to control the two halves of your body simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a series of quick single-screen platforming levels, Ambidextro will help you master controlling two characters at once, one with each hand. Learn to split your focus and tackle increasingly challenging levels you would have thought impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A multi-player game for a single player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Control one character with each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Make your two-halves meet before the time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 100  levels to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Retro dark-fantasy atmosphere with a dungeon synth soundtrack.</p>",
